                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu huyo Mungu amemtukuza kwa mkono wake wa kuume, awe Mkuu na Mwokozi, awape Waisraeli toba na msamaha wa dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.31",
