                  "text": "Mdo 22:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakakubali maneno yake; nao walipowaita mitume, wakawapiga, wakawaamuru wasinene kwa jina lake Yesu; kisha wakawaacha waende zao. ",
          "type": "text",
